name: ["Arguel's Blood Fast // Temple of Aclazotz", "Conqueror's Galleon // Conqueror's Foothold", 'Dowsing Dagger // Lost Vale', 'Growing Rites of Itlimoc // Itlimoc, Cradle of the Sun', "Legion's Landing // Adanto, the First Fort", 'Primal Amulet // Primal Wellspring', 'Search for Azcanta // Azcanta, the Sunken Ruin', 'Thaumatic Compass // Spires of Orazca', 'Treasure Map // Treasure Cove', "Vance's Blasting Cannons // Spitfire Bastion"]
